---
title: "E-Commerce Checkout & Payment Authentication Flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client App
  participant Auth Service
  participant Database
  participant Payment Gateway
  Client App->>Auth Service: Login Credentials
  Auth Service->>Database: Query User Profile
  Database-->>Auth Service: Profile Data
  Auth Service-->>Client App: JWT Access Token
  Client App->>Payment Gateway: Initiate Checkout
  Payment Gateway->>Auth Service: Validate Token Session
  Auth Service-->>Payment Gateway: Session Valid
  Payment Gateway->>Database: Record Transaction
  Database-->>Payment Gateway: Transaction Confirmed
  Payment Gateway-->>Client App: Payment Successful
